# PRESETS through the user presets (fm1-loom: two or more knit user presets saved from one factory sound; PRESETS
# from U1 went to the factory sound's neighbours, U2 only came from the first preset): a user preset keeps its factory
# sound's name, so where PRESETS is comes from the preset picked last, not the first sound of that name
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
knob 3 engine knit
preset 3 dusty_pad knit
usersave 3 1
usersave 3 2
usersave 3 3
preset 3 U1
tap EDIT
listen
turn PRESET 1
said U2
turn PRESET 1
said U3
turn PRESET -1
said U2
turn PRESET -1
said U1
turn PRESET -1
unsaid U
